              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Patience? (patientia, patientiae.) A tear? (lacrima, lacrimae.) A laugh? (rīsus, rīsūs.) A voice? (vōx, vōcis.) Mind? (animus, animī.) At last? (tandem.) From now on? (posthāc.) Still? (adhūc.) Suddenly? (subitō.) Until; while? (dōnec.) Earlier? (prius.) Every year? (quotannīs.) Now and then? (nōnnumquam.) Once? (semel.) Twice? (bis.) Far? (longē.) Elsewhere? (alibī.) Over there? (illīc.) Within? (intus.) Out of doors? (forīs.)"
